 "whatTheStaleFilesAre": "Six of the eight hold no queue row at all -- they are FAIL_REPAIR_REQUIRED and carry no live receipt, so their admitted file is the record of a run against bytes that have since been repaired, which is what a superseded receipt is for. Two are proven and their old receipts are recorded as superseded beside a current one.",
